got to be so key to cloud.

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.970
DAVE RENSIN: The
basic religion is

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:09.880
that reliability is the most
important feature of a cloud.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:12.942
