00:04:41.396 --> 00:04:44.820
INDRANIL CHAKRABORTY: Sure,
we have two sessions on IoT

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:47.080
at Next, two breakout sessions.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:51.370
One is called Developing IoT
Solution on Google Cloud.

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:54.465
And second is IoT and Cloud
for Industry Applications.

00:04:54.465 --> 00:04:55.480
DREA ALFONSO: Got it.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.146
And before we dive into that,
what do you do at Google?

00:04:58.146 --> 00:05:00.070
INDRANIL CHAKRABORTY:
So I'm a product manager

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.480
with Google Cloud.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:06.160
And my job really is to
do anything and everything

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.640
to build great products
which delights customer.

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:13.930
So I work with customers
to understand their needs.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:16.450
I work with our engineering
team very closely,

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:19.330
UX Design Team,
Partnership Team.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:22.135
So we're building features which
customers can really value.

00:05:22.135 --> 00:05:24.784
DREA ALFONSO: And for
talking about IoT at Next,

00:05:24.784 --> 00:05:25.700
why is that important?

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:27.949
Why is that important to
bring those types of sessions

00:05:27.949 --> 00:05:28.980
