00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:32.650
INDRANIL CHAKRABORTY: I think
IoT is at an inflection point.

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:35.810
We're seeing lot
of our customers

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:39.850
across manufacturing,
retail, even logistics

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:44.500
building really interesting
solution on Google Cloud.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:49.300
So we think that we
really want to share

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:53.440
with a broader audience
what we think internally,

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:57.310
how we think about IoT
internally, and also share

00:05:57.310 --> 00:06:00.520
the products we have on Cloud
as well as on the device

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:03.520
side, which developers
can use to build

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:04.810
really scalable applications.

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:07.690
DREA ALFONSO: And you mentioned
an interesting solution

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:08.860
