interesting solutions

00:06:12.378 --> 00:06:15.097
that you're seeing
manufacturing companies develop?

00:06:15.097 --> 00:06:16.180
INDRANIL CHAKRABORTY: Yes.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.790
In fact, in one of the
sessions, one of our customer

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:20.620
is going to explain
and getting deeper

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.760
into a very interesting
solution they

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:25.240
have built with
manufacturing clients

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:28.690
where you can look across
all the different factories

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:31.780
and the manufacturing
processes, remotely monitor it,

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:34.990
get real-time insights
across all of your factories.

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:37.030
So we think there's
a lot of value there.

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:38.037
DREA ALFONSO: Awesome.

00:06:38.037 --> 00:06:40.120
And so when we're talking
about the future of IoT,

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.260
what are you most excited about?

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.843
INDRANIL CHAKRABORTY:
Yeah, I'm really

00:06:42.843 --> 00:06:46.150
excited the intersection of
IoT and machine learning.

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:49.770
If you think about what we have
done with our own data centers,

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:51.420
we've collected
vast amounts of data

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:56.960
from chillers, coolers,
and our HVAC system,

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:00.366
outside temperature, the
humidity and wind speed.

00:07:00.366 --> 00:07:01.740
And we've collected
all this data

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:05.310
and we've built machine learning
models, which has effectively

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:08.940
improved, significantly
improved our power utilization

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:10.090
efficiency.

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:12.710
So I think there will be
a lot more applications

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:13.590
at this intersection.

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:15.945
And that's really interesting
over the next couple of years.

00:07:15.945 --> 00:07:18.030
DREA ALFONSO: Well thanks
Indranil for joining us today.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.890
And definitely looking forward
to checking out the session

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:20.190
online.

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:21.140
INDRANIL CHAKRABORTY:
Great, thank you.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:22.520
DREA ALFONSO: Thanks.

