00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:28.684
TERRENCE RYAN: Hi,
my names Terry Ryan.

00:07:28.684 --> 00:07:30.930
I'm a developer advocate
for Google Cloud platform.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.460
And my job is to
basically go around

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:34.530
