00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:44.690
DREA ALFONSO: How
long is way long?

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:47.640
FRANCESC CAMPOY: I think
I could go for six years.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.707
And I was not a developer
advocate before.

00:11:49.707 --> 00:11:51.040
But I joined developer advocacy.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:53.610
Ad And I always
liked podcasts, so I

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:54.950
