is way too much work.

00:11:57.394 --> 00:11:58.685
ALFONSO: Can't do it by myself.

00:11:58.685 --> 00:11:59.601
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah.

00:11:59.601 --> 00:12:00.582
And Mark joined.

00:12:00.582 --> 00:12:01.290
MARK MANDEL: Yep.

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:02.865
FRANCESC CAMPOY: And he was
like, we should do a podcast.

00:12:02.865 --> 00:12:05.022
And I was like,
that's a good idea.

00:12:05.022 --> 00:12:06.012
[LAUGHTER]

00:12:06.012 --> 00:12:07.220
So yeah, that's pretty much--

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:07.890
MARK MANDEL: That's
pretty much it.

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:07.980
Yeah.

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:08.460
MARK MANDEL: Yep.

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:09.300
